eye-contact-co-processing-at-the-speed-of-light-lines-13 = cons "## 10. Connection to the Information Dynamic" (cons "" (cons "Across the Information Dynamic framework (`chem/facts.hypercubical`, `neuro/coproc.hypercubical`, `neuro/synesthesia.hypercubical`), bounded observers form compressed models (quotients) over their accessible observation fibers. Accessibility is bounded by two constraints: relativistic light-cone latency and intermediate abstraction layers." (cons "" (cons "Eye contact approaches the physical limit on both axes simultaneously—nanosecond photon transit, millions of parallel photoreceptor channels, single-stage transduction, bidirectional feedback, and autonomic leakage. It is the biological realization of interpersonal synesthesia (*consensus*, Latin *con-* + *sentire*: perceiving together): two bounded conscious systems maximally coupling their receptive lenses while preserving distinct boundaries." (cons "" nil)))))
